INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Q1. Is Agile a process or a methodology?

Answer:
Agile is generally referred to as a software development methodology or
approach. Scrum is a framework that implements Agile principles.

--------------------------------------------------

Q2. Is Agile mandatory for every project?

Answer:
No. Agile is not mandatory. Organizations choose it when requirements are
expected to change frequently and continuous customer feedback is valuable.

--------------------------------------------------

Q3. What are the two most important characteristics of Agile?

Answer:

• Iterative development
• Incremental delivery

--------------------------------------------------

Q4. Why was Agile introduced?

Answer:
To overcome the limitations of the Waterfall model by enabling continuous
customer collaboration, faster feedback, and adaptability to changing
requirements.

